Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: The number of `:Pad(n)` is String (text), not Int
  --> tests/ui/E0112_selector_number_not_int.jet:4:23
    |
  4 |     print("[{name:Pad(width)}]")
    |                       ^^^^^
 Why: A selector number is an Int, written as a literal or computed at run time
 Fix: Pass an Int, such as `:Pad(width)` with `width: Int`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
